up|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|This is an interesting hand to play and East may have caused herself a problem. 4@S is a better contract than 3N. Actually 3N might go down since they only have eight sure tricks and we can take four clubs and a diamond if we defend correctly.|
