cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@C, at best, is iffy. To open 2@C, you need to have nine winners and four |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=quicktricks,Quick Tricks^*N|CP||FP||at|. So technically it is not a 2@C opener.|

