nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Further, it is hard to count the tricks. West can count four hearts, one spade, and two or three diamonds for sure. That is shy of nine sure tricks. So on second thought, 1@H is the correct bid, though 2@C is not totally unreasonable. |
