nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So, this worked out well for EW. 2@H bid, |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=michaels,Michaels^*N|CP||FP||at| was fine because of the lack of quality hearts and nice spades.|
PG| ***** 84 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Generally with 6-5 it is better to bid your 6 card suit because a vast majority of the time that is where you will end up playing.|
PG| ***** 85 ***** |


