mb|P|mb|1S|mb|2H|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I don't agree with 2@H although many players would bid it. You should only make a two level overcall if a) you have a 6-card suit, or b) you have a quality 5-card suit, or c) you have a singleton in their suit particularly at this vulnerability.|
